Error: Jet.TraitNotImplemented: `Bytes` isn't `Encode`
  --> Tests/UI/codec_impl_bytes_not_encodable.jet:7:19
    |
  7 | run: fn() { print(need(Bytes.from([U8]{1}))) }
    |                   ^^^^
 Why: `Bytes` would need to implement `Encode` before it can be used here
 Fix: `Bytes` is built into the compiler without `Encode`, and no impl can add it; convert the value to a type that has `Encode` first
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.TraitNotImplemented
